[h3]Intro:[/h3]
ZUN-CAPs are self-splitting and covering the whole Gensoukyo up! Do something before it's too late!

[h3]Rule:[/h3]
1. Right character must be matched with the caps to elimimate the caps;
2. The character will become a cap if mismatched with the cap;
3. You win if you cleared all caps that can split;
4. You lose if the parameter is breached.

[h3]Controlling:[/h3]
1. Move Reimu with mouse;
2. Left click to throw;
3. ESC to exit game;
4. Switch to fullscreen/window with ALT+ENTER.

[h3]Tips:[/h3]
1. This game is a little bit difficult and we'll work on balancing that;
2. You cannot adjust the volume in the game in this version.

[h3]Touhou Game Jam Website：[/h3]
https://touhougamejam2020.web.app/

Touhou Ibunseki - Ayaria Dawn: ReCreation is now in early access stage and has not reached its complete form. Many contents including characters, maps and skill cards will be changed or added. Should you encounter with some problems or have suggestions, please leave a message in the steam discussion board. We'll reply as soon as we can.

